 r←Test_Misc_039(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;key;value;target;qdmx
⍝ Exercise `ComposeDependencySetting` and `AddDependencyTarget`.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 →T.PassesIf'pkgs'≡##.Cider.ComposeDependencySetting'pkgs' ''
 →T.PassesIf'pkgs=Foo.Goo'≡##.Cider.ComposeDependencySetting'pkgs' 'Foo.Goo'

 key←'dependencies_dev.tatin'
 →T.PassesIf'pkgs=Foo'≡key ##.Cider.AddDependencyTarget'pkgs' 'Foo'
 →T.PassesIf'my pkgs=Foo.Goo'≡key ##.Cider.AddDependencyTarget'my pkgs' 'Foo.Goo'

⍝ Has a target already, has no folder, is invalid, gets an absolute target, gets a target with a blank:
 :For value target :InEach ('pkgs=Foo' '' 'pkgs=A=B' 'pkgs' 'pkgs')('Goo' 'Goo' 'Goo' '#.Goo' 'A B')
     :Trap 11
         {}key ##.Cider.AddDependencyTarget value target
         →T.PassesIf 0
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         →T.PassesIf∨/('"',key,'"')⍷qdmx.EM
     :EndTrap
 :EndFor

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
